DESCRIPTION:With the recent popularity of new programming languages that ar
 e improving the Python ecosystem\, one cannot dismiss the role of “old
 ” languages like C++\, and how the new versions might stay relevant.\nOn
  this talk\, we will dive directly into the internals on how the Qt for Py
 thon project brought one of the most popular C++ frameworks into Python - 
 but not only with 1-to1 bindings.
